sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: n/a<br>Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State: Charging Station set to Unavailable<br>(Original status was Available)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to change the availability<br>of the Charging Station to Inoperative.

    CSMS->>CS: ChangeAvailabilityRequest (operationalStatus = Operative)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: operationalStatus must be Operative<br>evseId must be omitted<br>connectorId must be omitted

    CS-->>CSMS: ChangeAvailabilityResponse (status = Accepted)

    loop For all connectors
        Note over CS,CSMS: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of the connector
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available)
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = Available, component.name = Connector, variable.name = AvailabilityState)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
